it was inappropriate, that's not

00:36:14.900 --> 00:36:15.919
proof of that.

00:36:15.920 --> 00:36:17.059
So I think that, you know, in terms

00:36:17.060 --> 00:36:18.709
of those proceedings are

00:36:18.710 --> 00:36:20.269
confidential. We have not seen the

00:36:20.270 --> 00:36:21.739
