00:36:21.740 --> 00:36:23.239
We do know that there were some very

00:36:23.240 --> 00:36:25.069
strange behaviors

00:36:25.070 --> 00:36:26.480
around her and her kids

00:36:27.500 --> 00:36:29.269
that may have been related to both

00:36:29.270 --> 00:36:30.739
mental illness and drug addiction,

00:36:30.740 --> 00:36:32.989
but we just don't know.

00:36:32.990 --> 00:36:34.459
I agree. conservatorship is very

00:36:34.460 --> 00:36:36.339
radical. There is,

00:36:36.340 --> 00:36:38.239
in some cases it's appropriate, but

00:36:38.240 --> 00:36:39.859
