00:36:47.390 --> 00:36:48.199
the people that are getting

00:36:48.200 --> 00:36:49.789
conservatorship, it's a pretty

00:36:49.790 --> 00:36:51.469
extreme circumstances.

00:36:51.470 --> 00:36:52.339
I mean, you gotta remember we have

00:36:52.340 --> 00:36:54.289
cases out here where it's like

00:36:54.290 --> 00:36:55.999
people will have been in like a car

